This role is responsible for identifying opportunities to improve finance processes, eliminating inefficiencies, strengthening controls, standardizing ways of working, and helping finance operate more effectively at scale. This is an ideal opportunity for someone who enjoys solving business problems, challenging the status quo and driving continuous improvement across a complex finance organisation.&nbsp;

Working across Finance team members in all regions and partnering with technology, supply chain, retail and other business functions you will lead process reviews, facilitate workshops, analyse current ways of working and design practical improvements and deliver measurable business value. The scope doesn't stop at fixing today's problems but it contributes to thinking about redesigning the processes that are scalable for the future.&nbsp;

The Senior Specialist - Finance process excellence&nbsp; will report to Head of Finance Automation &amp; Enablement on the Finance operations Excellence team supporting the Finance function across the globe.

&nbsp;

Your Mission:

-&nbsp; Map current (As-is) and future (To-be) processes&nbsp; across Record to Report, Procure to Pay, Order to Cash, Treasury, Tax and Master Data.

-&nbsp; Facilitate stakeholder workshops and analyze operational and financial data to identify trends, pain points, and strategic improvement opportunities

- Apply Lean and continuous improvement techniques to simplify processes. Support root cause analysis using structured problem solving techniques.

-&nbsp; Build and maintain a pipeline of process improvement initiatives. Measure and report realised business benefits.

