-&nbsp; Excellent process improvement and analytical skills, with experience in process mapping, root cause analysis, Lean or continuous improvement methodologies, and translating insights into practical solutions.

-&nbsp; Strong Stakeholder management and facilitation skills, with the ability to influence, challenge constructively, and build trusted relationships across finance and cross-functional teams.&nbsp;

-&nbsp; Experience with ERP (ideally D365 FO) and tools like Excel/Google sheet, Looker, Miro, Parabola or any workflow builder, AI agents, and process mining tool.

